2026-07-27T07:40:11.4727011Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T07:40:11.4727751Z i /tmp/Rtmp7fq7fD/duckdb
2026-07-27T07:40:11.4728217Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T07:40:11.4728743Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T07:40:11.4729602Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T07:40:11.4730350Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T07:40:11.4731410Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T07:40:11.4732390Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T07:40:11.4931318Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:40:11.5029794Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:40:11.5363616Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:40:11.5471247Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
